# nono pin — the single source of truth for docker/Dockerfile.
#
# `version` is INFORMATIONAL only: the human-readable release the commit below
# was tagged as. Nothing is fetched or built from it.
# `commit` is THE PIN: the full 40-hex commit that tag v0.74.0 points at. A
# commit id is itself a content hash, so it is the immutable thing the
# Dockerfile checks out and verifies with `git rev-parse HEAD`.
#
# cli#341 S1's CI gate reads `commit` from this same file.
